  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "To find the percentage of sunflower bouquets:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{12}{50}\\times 100\\% = 24\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24\\%}\n\\]",
    "No problem—the wording does not change the calculation. Faraday’s flower shop sold 50 bouquets, and 12 were sunflower bouquets:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{12}{50}\\times 100\\%=24\\%\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24\\%}\n\\]",
    "Faraday sold 12 sunflower bouquets over 6 days.\n\n\\[\n\\frac{12}{6}=2\n\\]\n\nSo, Faraday sold an average of:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{2\\text{ sunflower bouquets per day}}\n\\]",
